{"id":"973416abd14c9783","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-bornological.md","title":"Bornological Space","display":"df-bornological — Bornological Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bornological","aliases":["58-df-bornological"],"display":"df-bornological — Bornological Space","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bornological"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bornological</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bornological — Bornological Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,B,D,U\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,B,D,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\\)</span>（局部凸空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d71608bc30daeda\" href=\"?note=7d71608bc30daeda\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（显式携带载体、标量域与线性运算的绝对凸圆盘谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（此处定义的拓扑向量空间有界集谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>（此处定义的吸收所有有界集的圆盘谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bornological}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{Bornological}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>（此处定义的 bornological 空间谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\cdot_X B\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\cdot_Xx:x\\in B\\}\">\\(\\lambda\\cdot_X B\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\cdot_Xx:x\\in B\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq r\\cdot_XD\">\\(B\\subseteq r\\cdot_XD\\)</span> 表示取实标量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\cdot1_{\\mathbb F}\">\\(r\\cdot1_{\\mathbb F}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}disk} \\vdash \\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S(D,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow 0_X\\in D\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb F\\;\\Bigl(|\\alpha|+|\\beta|\\leq1\\to(\\alpha\\cdot_Xx)+_X(\\beta\\cdot_Xy)\\in D\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}disk} \\vdash \\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S(D,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow 0_X\\in D\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb F\\;\\Bigl(|\\alpha|+|\\beta|\\leq1\\to(\\alpha\\cdot_Xx)+_X(\\beta\\cdot_Xy)\\in D\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}bounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S(B,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\cdot_X,0_X)\n\\leftrightarrow\nB\\subseteq X\n\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\Bigl(\n0_X\\in U\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\bigl(B\\subseteq(r\\cdot1_{\\mathbb F})\\cdot_XU\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}bounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S(B,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\cdot_X,0_X)\n\\leftrightarrow\nB\\subseteq X\n\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\Bigl(\n0_X\\in U\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\bigl(B\\subseteq(r\\cdot1_{\\mathbb F})\\cdot_XU\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}bornivorous} \\vdash \\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S(D,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S(D,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S(B,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(B\\subseteq r\\cdot_XD)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}bornivorous} \\vdash \\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S(D,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S(D,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S(B,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(B\\subseteq r\\cdot_XD)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}space}\\vdash \\mathrm{Bornological}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S(D,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(0_X\\in U\\land U\\subseteq D)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}space}\\vdash \\mathrm{Bornological}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S(D,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(0_X\\in U\\land U\\subseteq D)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该定义使用 bornivorous disk：仅仅“吸收每个向量”不足以推出它是零邻域，必须吸收每个有界集。</li>\n<li>每个半赋范空间（特别是赋范空间）都是 bornological。</li>\n<li>从 bornological 空间到任意局部凸空间的线性映射若把有界集送到有界集，则连续；不需要在定义中加入拟完备性。</li>\n<li>对任意零邻域只需存在一个正实缩放倍数把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 包含进去。旧式“对所有模长足够大的复标量”会额外要求任意相位旋转后的邻域也包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，对非平衡邻域并不等价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S$（局部凸空间谓词，见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,B,D,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bornological}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\cdot_X B\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\cdot_Xx:x\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq r\\cdot_XD","display":false},{"tex":"r\\cdot1_{\\mathbb F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}disk} \\vdash \\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S(D,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow 0_X\\in D\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb F\\;\\Bigl(|\\alpha|+|\\beta|\\leq1\\to(\\alpha\\cdot_Xx)+_X(\\beta\\cdot_Xy)\\in D\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}bounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S(B,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\cdot_X,0_X)\n\\leftrightarrow\nB\\subseteq X\n\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\Bigl(\n0_X\\in U\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\bigl(B\\subseteq(r\\cdot1_{\\mathbb F})\\cdot_XU\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}bornivorous} \\vdash \\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S(D,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TVSDisk}_S(D,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{TVSBounded}_S(B,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;(B\\subseteq r\\cdot_XD)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bornological\\text{-}space}\\vdash \\mathrm{Bornological}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BornivorousDisk}_S(D,X,\\tau,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(0_X\\in U\\land U\\subseteq D)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","d